{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6a41129a-80a4-5d7a-bd80-bacac4cc24c9", "source_ordinal": 1891, "reading_ordinal": 2165, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "放养", "published_at": "2023-12-08T04:08:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/407582335/answer/3317542411"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "看了很多回答，发现基本都完全说错了方向。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "以前带孩子轻松，一个极大的原因是小孩几乎完全生活在熟人社会中。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "方圆十里地，从小卖部到卫生室、从粮店到保卫科、从子弟小学到厂矿食堂，所有的人都是同一个厂的员工家属。所有人认识所有人。学校老师下了班回家，搞不好就住你家隔壁。甚至就是走到镇上、县城街上，随便碰到一个人，就算不直接认识，也往往有共同的熟人朋友甚至亲戚。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "小孩是在一个几乎完全安全的人际环境中长大。所有的邻居、同事，甚至隔壁厂、隔壁村的人都会自然帮你照应。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这小猴子是谁家的，谁都门儿清。到点你不在学校或者没回家，人人都会给你看起来，通知你爹妈。爹妈招呼一声，临时管你顿饭甚至留你住一夜都是不足挂齿的事。你娃自己偷偷跑去游泳，几乎必定是跟着同楼的那一串猴崽子溜出去的。而且守鱼塘的大爷、路边卖煎饼的老师傅，一样帮你吼这帮不知死活的小屁孩。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "村里、乡里、单位大院里基本都是如此。整个社区几千号人都在替父母留神帮手，父母们当然放松得很。这根本就不是“夫妻二人轮岗确保子女全程避开一切莫测风险”的设定。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "和以前的成长环境比起来，现在的小孩就像用囚车连接起的一系列温室里培养起来的实验动物。全程无菌，所有接触者进出都要消毒。而父母、祖父母要负责顶住除学校之外所有的环境的监护工作，扮演“肉身无菌屏障”。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "岂能不筋疲力尽？", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "坦率讲，在城市长大对人类来说是一个非常新的生活方式，只不过短短两百年而已。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "人类幼崽在过去几千年文明史里，绝大多数都是在整个家族、整个部落的安全网里长大的。那通常是一个方圆数公里的大型游乐场，而且有大量的不同年龄层的玩伴和大量与自然界的交互。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那才是人类真正适应的成长环境。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“在城市里长大”的抚养模式，其实到目前来说都仍然是探索性、实验性的。观点路线还在诸子百家的纷乱状态，每一种都只实践了几十年，了不起覆盖一两代人就整个理念都变了。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "大量城市文明自诩的相对乡村的“先进”，在本质上只是用自夸来自我抚慰的迷茫。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为迷茫，反而需要用格外的自夸来补足自己内心深处的惶恐。", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不信你仔细体会，你会发现城市出身的父母在教导子女基本道德、价值观的时候几乎总是犹豫徘徊的。往往更重投机和机智，而非强调传统、义务和基本价值。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "隔壁两家、上下两楼的父母们给自己的子女讲着完全不同的伦理观点，往往还没等子女长大，父母自己的伦理观念又自行转变了，美其名曰“成熟”了。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "生娃时，父母二十几岁；娃到青春期，父母四十几了。四十几的父母还认同自己二十几岁时价值观的，有几个？", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你在子女十几岁时教的东西、讲的心得，和在ta们小时候教ta们的东西，真的是一以贯之的吗？", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1077}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这之间的断裂、变轨，子女难道不要付出代价吗？", "char_start": 1078, "char_end": 1100}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这种价值观上的迷茫感、精神上的不笃定感，是剧烈城市化的这一代父母较之上个世纪的父母们的又一大时代劣势。", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1152}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "物质上、事务上，没有整个社区的全方位分担，精神上、心灵上迷茫而孤独，而子女又是在人类其实并不适应的非传统栖居地成长。", "char_start": 1153, "char_end": 1211}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "焉能不累？", "char_start": 1212, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "要想克服这些问题，坦率说那个全社区相助是很难补足的，勉强只能说同小区、同班级几个同学家长互相多帮衬，尽量弥补一点，再靠父母、帮佣分担一点。这就是能指望的全部找补了，这也是为什么往往要迫使夫妻一方脱产来全职照顾。", "char_start": 1219, "char_end": 1324}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而那个“子女在非人类传统的条件下成长”也是几乎无法可想的。大多数人都只有“想尽办法进名校”这个办法来对冲。", "char_start": 1325, "char_end": 1378}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "唯一最可以努力、也最需要努力的、挑战也最大的，其实是父母自己的价值观迷茫和精神的不笃定。", "char_start": 1379, "char_end": 1423}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这个要靠对传统的大量的学习和吸收。", "char_start": 1424, "char_end": 1441}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "注意，这不是叫你去照搬、复活“老规矩”，而是指你需要深入“老规矩”的历史源流，理清这些老规矩、这些传统背后的机制和原理。", "char_start": 1442, "char_end": 1502}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你自己教给子女的，要是这些锤炼、检验了几千年的机制和原理在这个新的时代背景、社会条件下做出的新的答案，而不是罔顾时过境迁的事实，盲目的照搬历史结论。", "char_start": 1503, "char_end": 1577}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这绝不是一个赶学术时髦的过程——大量所谓的中产父母，都是在赶ta们面前喊得最响的“教育新理念”时髦，以盲目而极端的抛弃和背离传统为“更先进”的基本方法论，实则是一种自我放弃、一种思想的堕落而已。", "char_start": 1578, "char_end": 1675}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你的选择当然应该有别于传统，但那是在通过解读传统明白了真正的机制之后的再度运用的结果。", "char_start": 1676, "char_end": 1719}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这就像通过阅读研究往年试题，你学会了微积分，然后用微积分做你今年的卷子，你的答案当然不会和去年的考题答案一样。", "char_start": 1720, "char_end": 1775}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "但是微积分的算法是一样的。", "char_start": 1776, "char_end": 1789}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "“传统”不是去年卷子的答案，而是去年卷子考的那个微积分演算法。", "char_start": 1790, "char_end": 1821}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "找到这个算法，你就能站在这个算法五千年的辉煌成就的肩膀上做出新时代的新答案，答案是新的，但是方法仍然是那个经历五千年验证的方法。", "char_start": 1822, "char_end": 1886}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这才是你消除迷茫的真正路径。", "char_start": 1887, "char_end": 1901}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "为了这个原因，你必须要对历史——尤其是对社会学、人类学、宗教学、思想史、文化史下功夫。", "char_start": 1902, "char_end": 1945}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "三管齐下，再加一点运气，你可能可以不必这么绝望和焦虑。", "char_start": 1946, "char_end": 1973}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "另外，我严肃的建议你把我的答案看完。", "char_start": 1974, "char_end": 1992}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "因为这是你能找到最好的参考之一。", "char_start": 1993, "char_end": 2009}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "家族答集\n社科答集\n企管答集\n文艺答集\n科学答集\n军事技术与艺术\n第一性", "char_start": 2010, "char_end": 2046}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "另外，建议父母、准父母们订阅 爱发电的同名账号，那里有更多关于子女教育的深入探讨。", "char_start": 2046, "char_end": 2087}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 2010, "sample": "家族答集\n社科答集\n企管答集\n文艺答集\n科学答集\n军事技术与艺术\n第一性"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我带孩子都要崩溃了，为啥老一辈人那时候带孩子似乎很轻松?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041"], "summary": "围绕“放养”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“看了很多回答，发现基本都完全说错了方向。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "看了很多回答，发现基本都完全说错了方向。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8a3adbba-acb1-5edb-99a9-8ed7264642e3", "source_ordinal": 1890, "reading_ordinal": 2166, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "中山靖王之后", "published_at": "2023-12-10T01:21:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/309154799/answer/3319842097"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国有一个经常被人嘲笑的现象，叫做“攀祖宗”，这是在嘲讽在大量的族谱里面存在的“随意攀附古代名人”的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如这家姓刘，提笔就写中山靖王之后。姓吕的就写姜太公，姓赵的就写赵匡胤。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其实只有这些吗？", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "日本天皇自称从天照大神一代代生出来的。以色列人的先祖雅各和神摔跤，亲戚都攀到天上去了。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "按照很多学生 / 正义之士的看法，这都是一种“制造历史”的行为，属于“学术不端”。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是很遗憾，学术“端”不“端”，几乎根本不在这些家族领袖们的考虑范围之内。他们几乎根本就不会去考虑什么文献联系，考古证据。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们只考虑一条——这样的家族叙事，能给本家族创造什么样的精神财富和政治利益。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如，我们家地处边陲、结寨自保，并且姓李，我们是认李白做祖先好、要是认李广做祖先好？", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "认李广做祖先，本寨的骑射功夫自然就成了祖传技艺、成了文化身份，制弓造箭就会成为家族主权基金长期投资的战略项目。认李白，也许就多一些诗人剑客，灭亡之后本族的墓碑可能在文物市场上很抢手。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "傻缺才会认李白，活腻了吗？", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "选哪边，根本就不取决于我们家有没有什么东西、什么文件可以证明两李的血统，而取决于我们家族的整个战略定位和发展方向。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "本族能不能威震西陲，能不能令马贼胡匪不敢轻犯，要比“让一些文人找不到说嘴处”重要何止万倍。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在前一种利益面前，所谓的“学术不端”根本就微不足道——笑骂由人笑骂，好事我自为之。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这一般会形成一个江湖规矩——你论你的，我论我的，大家没有过节，就彼此奉行“不驳斥”的默认礼仪。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "用我可以认刘秀换你可以认李广。我不来质疑你跟李广的血缘关系，你也不要来指摘我的DNA和刘秀的遗体对不上。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "譬如，我们如果不是要找日本人麻烦，在国际礼仪上是不会去评论“神怎么生娃”这种问题的，我们也不会随便评论李舜臣到底有多少战绩，或者越南陈兴道到底多不能打。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你可以说你的，但是不去因为别人的自认和你的不匹配，就跑去跟人“当堂对质”，这是基本的江湖规矩。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你一定要这么干，你最好是自觉的意识到这是宣战行为，而不要傻乎乎的以为这是“学术讨论”。", "char_start": 809, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为人家来赴会，带的肯定不是纸和笔，而是刺刀和火箭炮。", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "任何人都有按照自己的口径自行认定自己的历史叙事的天然权利。除非你发现这影响到了你的利益，值得你投入这么大的成本、冒这么大的风险去树敌、摊牌，否则你最好不要主动去按照你的所谓真理标准跑去“纠错”。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 978}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为别人也默认不会这样来对你。", "char_start": 979, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "人家要这样对你，拿着ta的“学术标准”来抠你的历史叙事，也能让你家鸡犬不宁，你也一样会让对方付出沉重代价。", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "历史叙事首先是政治机制的结果，而不是史学规范的结果。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "如果你连这个都认识不到，你的历史学完全是白学了。", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1100}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一个学校的校史可以怎样强行往上算？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“中山靖王之后”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国有一个经常被人嘲笑的现象，叫做“攀祖宗”，这是在嘲讽在大量的族谱里面存在的“随意攀附古代名人”的现象。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国有一个经常被人嘲笑的现象，叫做“攀祖宗”，这是在嘲讽在大量的族谱里面存在的“随意攀附古代名人”的现象。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "aa902c5a-bb97-51b8-884c-f314d4116071", "source_ordinal": 1889, "reading_ordinal": 2167, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "非学术问题", "published_at": "2023-12-10T18:32:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/448399563/answer/3320519979"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "虽然这么说令人遗憾，但是你们一定要记住——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人类九成九的争辩都和学术讨论无关。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "小孩子“不爱国”的原因，几乎根本就和“中国如何不可爱”几乎没关系，那是因为ta出于某种原因要让某些他不喜欢而又很重视爱国的人痛苦、难受。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以这小子不自觉的要跟你唱这个反调，来“教训”你、让你知道ta不是好惹的。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要“说服”ta爱国，如果你用“拿出证明中国伟大的不可辩驳的证据”这种办法想改变小崽子的观点，说明你还没真正的明白社会生存的本质。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "能用学理证明来改变对方立场的前提，是对方和你利益一致而且对此有明确的自觉，简单来说，就是对方要先超越自身的具体利益纠葛，抛弃政治性的异见，先把自己上升到客观中立、不偏不倚的半神状态，去和另一个半神在圣殿里对话。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那是非常罕见、门槛很高的际遇，而这个小孩既然已经在你面前保持这份嘴脸，那么你要改变ta立场的最快做法就根本不是去讲什么“中国之伟大”，你多讲几句“对自由灯塔的无限向往”，ta下午就开始跟你谈高铁、北斗和福建号了。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "绝大多数情况下，所谓“观点争论”的本质都是某种自觉或不自觉的欲望发泄。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "大爷不准你进门，你跟大爷说“凭啥不让我进去，明明规定写的是一二三四……”，你就搞错了问题的本质。你话题一转，跟大爷闲话家常——“那我就不勉强了，我就在门口跟您聊会儿天，碰碰运气，要不闲着也是闲着，我们下盘象棋咋样。”", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你走后一条路，你半小时以后完全可能以“职工亲属探访“的事由完成登记，摇身一变“远房侄子”进去。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "就事论事、以理服人，前提是对方预先进入了讲道理的心态和模式。进了这个模式，才有讲道理的余地和有效性可言。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为只有在这个模式下，对方才会把注意力关注在你的话有哪些合理性上，而不是放在你的话有哪些不合理性上。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而要进入这个模式，关键在于对方确信你的爱足够可信。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "父母要对子女获得讲道理的资格，先要让子女直觉到自己的爱的立场无可质疑。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而要做到这种无可置疑，首要的努力绝不是多买玩具、千依百顺，而是先要在无数的案例上辨析清楚爱是什么，先完成爱的正确认知。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 845}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "然后才是依照原则尽力行事。", "char_start": 846, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这其实是子女是否懂得爱和确认父母的爱的问题。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在这一点上失败，那么父母越是珍视和高举什么，子女就越是鄙弃和践踏什么。", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在这一点上成功，父母相信什么，子女自然听从什么，用不着“证明”、“说服”。", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这根本就不是一个学术问题。", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 970}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何向12岁的弟弟，解释没有大国崛起，哪有小民尊严，而不使其厌烦？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“非学术问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“虽然这么说令人遗憾，但是你们一定要记住——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "虽然这么说令人遗憾，但是你们一定要记住——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d21163c9-0933-583f-a850-404236cad667", "source_ordinal": 1888, "reading_ordinal": 2168, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "好困难", "published_at": "2023-12-12T19:19:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/521803345/answer/3323153968"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题其实很简单的，那就是提高厨艺，做出“即使连这么不爱吃虾的人也停不下嘴”的虾料理呀。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "做人要有这么个意识——老天爷把困难放在你面前，你就总是有一个“连这都能搞定，其他更不在话下”的效应可以利用。你就可以把这个困难当作一大类痛点的首席代表来发起进攻。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这样，你在考虑“克服这个困难能获得什么收益”的时候，就很容易看到这不仅仅是解决了这么一个人的这么一件需求，而是解决了比这个人要求更低的一大群人的大量需求。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这样脑袋前面吊着的胡萝卜一下就放大了几十上百倍，自己这头驴也就自然可以嗷嗷叫着往前冲了。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个就是寻找“最好的困难”的要害——有多少人在为这个困难苦恼？你克服这个困难的过程中积累的经验、技术和工具可以再为多少人服务？", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你对这个认识得越深、越确切，你面对困难的斗志自然也越强——因为前头有重赏啊，重赏之下必有勇夫啊。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在我们来个回马枪——所以，如果你扎扎实实的战胜了抑郁症，那么你这取胜的经验、技术和工具又有多少人可以受益？", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "谁说你即使战胜了抑郁也只是“回到了普通人的原点”？", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你是回到了原点，还背回来两挺能打穿地狱的救苦救难加特林。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一挺一个亿，还美不死你？", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 486}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子抗拒吃鱼虾，如果被强迫吃就直接吞，因为食物太大导致干呕，怎样做才能让孩子接受吃鱼虾呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“好困难”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题其实很简单的，那就是提高厨艺，做出“即使连这么不爱吃虾的人也停不下嘴”的虾料理呀。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题其实很简单的，那就是提高厨艺，做出“即使连这么不爱吃虾的人也停不下嘴”的虾料理呀。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "451d52bb-bb6a-5d80-937b-1bcdc1b2ba20", "source_ordinal": 1887, "reading_ordinal": 2169, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "押错宝和下错注", "published_at": "2023-12-14T13:06:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/634447709/answer/3325292071"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "时至今日，不知道有多少人能吸取两年前战争刚爆发时的教训。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人是非常容易被某种够大量的声音影响的，那些朋友圈里对乌克兰和北约信心满满的人，你应该意识到他们的判断力和对自己的判断力的判断力都存在问题了。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "同样的，如果你当初被这些人影响，也去笃信“乌克兰必胜”“俄罗斯必然崩溃”“一旦动员俄就会分裂”“越境作战就只能靠长时间积蓄工业物资，然后发动一次性的突袭，稍遇不利必一败涂地”……", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你也要反省一下你自己的判断力和对自己判断力的判断力的问题。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "很多人在总结自己的判断失误的时候都把目光集中在表层——即命题本身的错误。我觉得俄罗斯会崩溃，结果俄罗斯没崩溃，所以我错了，我要去总结我为什么会误判俄罗斯的崩溃条件。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这是不够的，甚至不是最要害的问题。因为你往往不止犯了这样一个错误。你还犯了一个隐形的错——你非常确信自己对俄罗斯即将崩溃的判断本身是无可怀疑的，即错误的判断了自己判断的可靠性。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "每一个判断都不止包含对事实本身的结论，还包含了你对这个判断本身可靠性的判断。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如，我判断“张三可能要殴打李四”，其实话说到这里还没完，你还有一句“确信程度为60%”。（百分之五十确信等于不确信）。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你谨慎判断“俄罗斯将会因动员崩溃，确信程度65%”，那么你比那些确信“俄罗斯将因动员崩溃，确信程度100%”的人要正确，正确得多——尽管看上去你们俩的判断都被证明错误了，但只要假设上述的置信度是真诚的，你所受的损失要远比那些100%的人小。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这就是关键所在。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在“判断”这个课题上，准确的置信度比判断的内容本身更关键。你可以“搞错”判断的结论，但你不能搞错你结论的置信度。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这可以简单的表达为——对判断的判断，要重于判断自身。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在置信度的保护下，即使事后被验证为错误的判断也不会要你的命。一旦你搞错置信度，错误的判断就会对你造成深刻的甚至致命打击。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的判断失误，首先是失误在对判断本身的判断上，而不是判断的内容上。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "押错宝并不一定致命，是下错了赌注额度才真正导致你倾家荡产。如果你一开始对自己的判断本身有准确的判断，那么你就算押错宝，你也只下了20块的赌注——你没有在朋友群大肆鼓吹乌克兰必胜，没有在社交账号上四面出击把认为俄罗斯优势较大的人挨个凌辱，没有换黄蓝头像，没有改乌式昵称，那么就算现在证明你押错了宝，你的损失也不会是弄到要注销账号。何况熟人朋友圈注销有什么用？人家已经看见你是容易被裹挟洗脑而且还不靠谱的傻瓜。这个印象你不知多少年才能洗刷。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "现在你再反观当初那些战鼓擂得震天响的三无小号，一个比一个“信心十足”、“乌克兰必胜”，然而ta们现在到底会输掉什么？不过是一个个注册手续而已。ta们的赌注比砖头还便宜，抛砖就是为了引你这玉。到时候ta们转头一扔就操起另一块砖头，你呢？", "char_start": 1023, "char_end": 1140}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你身败名裂。", "char_start": 1141, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "再说一遍——押错宝乃是人生日常，真正的错误，在于你下了不相称的重注。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "押错宝和下错注是两个问题。你可以押错宝，但是要想清楚你看好这一边的力度到底有大，你的把握到底有多少。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1234}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "押错宝和下错注是两个问题。", "char_start": 1235, "char_end": 1248}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "下对注，押错宝没有大关系——因为你可以以较小的代价获得经验，甚至经验教训本身比你输掉的那点赌注更值钱。", "char_start": 1249, "char_end": 1300}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "下错注才是你万劫不复的根本原因。", "char_start": 1301, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "永远记住，对判断的判断重于判断自身。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1336}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老亚当认为乌军即将撤退，释放出什么信号？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“押错宝和下错注”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“时至今日，不知道有多少人能吸取两年前战争刚爆发时的教训。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "时至今日，不知道有多少人能吸取两年前战争刚爆发时的教训。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "93d924a5-2867-5704-a190-8718c2c3b109", "source_ordinal": 1886, "reading_ordinal": 2170, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "No Soup For You", "published_at": "2023-12-14T20:47:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/634065846/answer/3325844037"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "小米请原研哉改logo，原研哉收费200万。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是不是一门“文科生意”？是不是服务业？", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "原研哉所做的算是“舔”吗？", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果这也算是“舔”，“舔”的定义就有点神奇了。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "坦率讲，觉得自己是被服务者，于是就觉得服务者都只是自己意志的奴仆，认为对方一定会谄媚、逢迎，而且还特别要确保对方屈从于自己的一切意志，这是非常低级甚至荒唐的人生体验。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "几乎总是搞出“医生说我是肺炎，而我不批准”“请李白作诗，然后自己改词”这种奇葩的事。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你真进入这些高端服务领域，会发现顶尖的服务者根本不缺主顾，只有人家挑客户，没有客户挑ta的道理。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "小到一碗靓汤、一碟炒粉，大到品牌战略、商业定位，你都要依赖顶尖人才的服务，而这些人才绝不缺少排队的人愿意忍受ta们的脾气。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人人都知道只要拿到这些人的服务就铁定赚了，如果你还做梦要这些人来“舔”你，你才肯“赏脸光顾”ta们的生意，那你这辈子都不可能得到这些人的服务。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "于是你在得到这些人的良好服务的对手面前，如同待宰的羔羊。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一定要说的话——如果你没有在“舔”你手下的核心骨干，想方设法令ta们真心愿意付出最大努力，只有一种解释——一定是你的骨干们太废、是一群根本没有别人会用的可怜人，而你已经快完蛋了。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这不是“颠倒黑白”的问题，而是不知死活的愚蠢。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ps：google “soup nazi”.", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 558}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-12/14/3172b1a7df08f36163cb8e0560d64468.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0321"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：张雪峰回应「文科都是服务业」，称「做服务业没有不好，我是提醒以为某些专业高大上的人」，如何看待此事？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“No Soup For You”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“小米请原研哉改logo，原研哉收费200万。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "小米请原研哉改logo，原研哉收费200万。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
